OL,3,GNEWSACouple hope D-Day boat bought on
OL,4,AeBay will sail again
OL,5,
OL,6,FA couple who bought a World War Two
OL,7,FD-Day boat on eBay are trying to
OL,8,Frestore it in time to sail it back to
OL,9,FNormandy for the 85th anniversary of
OL,10,Fthe landings.
OL,12,FSimon and Gemma Robins saved the vessel
OL,13,Ffrom the scrap heap when they bought it
OL,14,Fin 2021.
OL,16,F"We never planned on buying a World War
OL,17,FTwo boat, especially one that was so
OL,18,Frotten and so big," Gemma said.
OL,20,F"But my husband likes a challenge and I
OL,21,Ffell in love with the history of it."
